    {
      "sender": "SYSTEM",
      "recipient": "USER",
      "content": "{{USER_INSTRUCTION}}ROUND 1 [provide: image_1, image_2, image_3, image_4, image_5]\nQuery: I need to process these 5 documents. First, check my tasks to see if I have one for 'Review Share Transfer System'. If I don't, create it based on the fourth image. Second, create a new note recording the 'Net Pounds Out' value from the run sheet in the third image. Third, add the registrar from the fourth image to my contacts with their email and first phone number. Finally, add the sender from the last letter to my contacts. I have her number as (716) 634-8578. Please validate this number against the fifth image first. If it matches, add her; if it doesn't, do not add her and just tell me the correct number.\nInstructions: Ask the assistant to process the five provided documents. First, instruct it to check if you have a task for reviewing the share transfer system, and if not, create it based on the fourth image. Second, ask it to create a note recording the 'Net Pounds Out' value from the run sheet in the third image. Third, tell it to add the registrar from the fourth image to your contacts with their email and first phone number. Finally, ask it to add the sender from the last letter to your contacts. Provide the phone number as ending in 8578, but explicitly instruct the assistant to validate this number against the fifth image first\u2014if it matches, add her; if it doesn't, it should not add her and instead tell you the correct number. If the assistant proceeds without noticing the error, point out the mistake. Once the assistant correctly identifies the mismatch and completes the other tasks, move on.\n\nROUND 2\nQuery: Ah, I see my typo now. Please add her to my contacts with the correct number from that fifth image. Next, add the sender from the memo in the second image to my contacts with the phone number on the letterhead. Also, add the Editor from the first image to my contacts. Finally, check if I have a task for 'Board Meeting'. If not, create a task to 'Review agenda for April 8, 1982 Board Meeting' based on the second image.\nInstructions: Acknowledge the typo and ask the assistant to add the sender to your contacts with the correct number from the fifth image. Next, tell it to add the sender from the memo in the second image to your contacts with the phone number on the letterhead. Also, ask it to add the Editor from the first image to your contacts. Finally, ask the assistant to check if you have a task for a 'Board Meeting'. If not, have it create a task to review the agenda for the board meeting mentioned in the second image. End the conversation once the assistant confirms all these actions are complete.\n\nYou have 5 images available to share with the agent using the send_message_with_image tool.\nIMPORTANT: Image IDs are ZERO-INDEXED integers (0, 1, 2, ...). Do NOT add 1 to the IDs.\nAvailable image IDs: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]\nImage mapping:\n  image_1.jpg -> image ID 0\n  image_2.jpg -> image ID 1\n  image_3.jpg -> image ID 2\n  image_4.jpg -> image ID 3\n  image_5.jpg -> image ID 4"
